<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Nov consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Argentine Nov consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in November, the Economy Ministry said:</p>
<p>    Food				    -0.4</p>
<p>    Clothing				-0.1</p>
<p>    Housing				 -0.4</p>
<p>    Household goods			0.0</p>
<p>    Health				  -0.1</p>
<p>    Transport and communications     0.2</p>
<p>    Entertainment			  0.5</p>
<p>    Education				0.0</p>
<p>    Others				  -0.1</p>
<p>    Total				   -0.2</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
